flowchart TD
 A[Buyer creates and signs mandate] --> B[Agent validates request and mandate]
 B -->|Within scope and budget| C[Agent creates trade]
 B -->|Out of policy| X[Reject and log action]
 C --> D[Contract atomically reserves budget]
 D --> E[Supplier accepts]
 E --> F[Buyer funds exact SDD]
 F --> G[Reservation becomes consumed budget]
 G --> H[Supplier commits required documents]
 H --> I[Buyer assigns registered inspector]
 I --> J[Inspector submits final attestation]
 J -->|Pass + mandate permits immediate release| K[Agent authorizes release]
 J -->|Pass + no agent permission| L[Buyer confirmation path]
 L --> M[Buyer confirms before 72h deadline]
 J -->|Fail + mandate permits refund| N[Agent authorizes refund]
 J -->|Fail + no agent permission| O[Buyer chooses refund or dispute]
 K --> P[Authorized settlement trigger]
 M --> P
 N --> Q[Authorized refund trigger]
 O -->|Refund| Q
 O -->|Dispute| R[Independent resolver]
 R -->|Release| P
 R -->|Refund| Q
 P --> S[Async payout]
 Q --> T[Async refund]
 S -->|Success| U[Completed]
 T -->|Success| V[Refunded]
 S -->|Failure| K
 T -->|Failure| N
